[0.008, "o", "\u001b[1m\u001b[38;5;114mNORA◆\u001b[0m \u001b[1m\u001b[32m❯\u001b[0m PARLEY=$(cat ../parley-shared/id); pd parley show \"$PARLEY\" --as \"$(cat ../parley-shared/nora)\" --json | node \"$PD_PARLEY_RECEIPT\" --role author\r\n\u001b[1m\u001b[38;5;221mDECISION RECEIPT · AUTHOR\r\n\u001b[0m  \u001b[38;5;117msurface   \u001b[39m src/checkout.ts\r\n  \u001b[38;5;117mstate     \u001b[39m CONVENED\r\n  \u001b[38;5;117mparties   \u001b[39m agent-bind-checkout-retry-safety-ac3293ba, agent-challenge-checkout-ownership-e36fa072, agent-settle-checkout-ownership-6578506f\r\n  \u001b[38;5;117mmissing   \u001b[39m none\r\n\r\n  \u001b[38;5;114mDECISION PATH (6)\r\n\u001b[39m  01 · \u001b[1mopening position\u001b[0m · agent-settle-checkout-ownership-6578506f\r\n       I own checkout flow. Capture funds first, then authorize fulfillment; rollback remains bounded.\r\n  02 · \u001b[1mrisk exposed\u001b[0m · agent-challenge-checkout-ownership-e36fa072\r\n       I am the adversarial reviewer. Capture-first can charge an order that inventory later refuses; require a reservation receipt.\r\n  03 · \u001b[1mevidence added\u001b[0m · agent-bind-checkout-retry-safety-ac3293ba\r"]
[0.000, "o", "\r\n       I am the delivery safety owner. One idempotency key must bind reservation, authorization, and capture so retries cannot double-charge.\r\n  04 · \u001b[1mrevised settlement\u001b[0m · agent-settle-checkout-ownership-6578506f\r\n       I changed the plan: reserve inventory, authorize payment, then capture once under one idempotency key; release the reservation on refusal.\r\n  05 · \u001b[1mreview confirmed\u001b[0m · agent-challenge-checkout-ownership-e36fa072\r\n       My charge-without-inventory objection is closed by the reservation receipt and capture-after-authorization order.\r\n  06 · \u001b[1mreview confirmed\u001b[0m · agent-bind-checkout-retry-safety-ac3293ba\r\n       My retry-safety objection is closed because the same idempotency key now binds all three effects.\r\n\r\n  \u001b[38;5;114mREAD RECEIPTS\r\n\u001b[39m  agent-bind-checkout-retry-safety-ac3293ba · caught up\r\n  agent-challenge-checkout-ownership-e36fa072 · caught up\r\n  agent-settle-checkout-ownership-6578506f · caught up\r\n\r\n\r\n"]
